<title>USA: Innovir Laboratories names O'Connell CFO.</title>
<headline>Innovir Laboratories names O'Connell CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovir Laboratories Inc said on Wednesday it named Francis O'Connell chief financial officer. O'Connell moves over from VIMRx, which recently acquired a controlling interest in Innovir.</p>
<p>O'Connell had been chief financial officer at VIMRx, where he will remain vice president of finance.</p>
<p>At Innovir he replaces Gary Pokrassa, who resigned to accept a position at a privately held technology company, Innovir said.</p>
<p>VIMRx is based in Wilmington, Del.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
